# TiBillet module - English
ModuleTiBilletName = TiBillet
TiBilletDescription = Every day, depending on the chosen mode: imports TiBillet cash closures into the general ledger (entries not validated), or copies TiBillet's catalogue then its sales (products, paid invoices, transfers, various payments).
TiBilletImportDesClotures = TiBillet closures import
TiBilletTacheCommentaire = Depending on the chosen mode: imports TiBillet closures into the general ledger, or copies TiBillet's catalogue then its sales. Does nothing until the address and key are set (Setup → Modules → TiBillet).
TiBilletReglages = TiBillet settings
TiBilletExplication = Every night at %s, Dolibarr fetches the venue's daily closures it does not have yet from TiBillet. It creates the missing accounts and journals, then writes the entries into the general ledger, <b>not validated</b>: your accountant reviews, then validates them.
TiBilletAdresse = TiBillet venue address
TiBilletAdresseAide = Example: https://myvenue.tibillet.coop (the venue's main address, https)
TiBilletCle = TiBillet API key
TiBilletCleAide = Created in TiBillet's admin (API keys), with only the "Accounting (read)" right. Leave empty to keep the saved key.
TiBilletCleDefinie = A key is saved.
TiBilletCleAbsente = No key saved.
TiBilletMode = What the module sends into Dolibarr
TiBilletModeAide = Only one of the two, never both: otherwise every sale would be counted twice in the accounts.
TiBilletModeEcritures = Accounting entries: every night, the daily closures go into the general ledger (like the FEC).
TiBilletModeVentes = Items and sales: every day, TiBillet's catalogue then the sales of closed days, as paid invoices.
TiBilletModeVentesRienAImporter = "Items and sales" mode: TiBillet closures are not imported into the general ledger.
TiBilletModeVentesPasDeReimport = "Items and sales" mode: a closure cannot be re-imported.
TiBilletModeChangeAlerte = Warning: you changed the mode while %s closure(s) are already in the general ledger. The same days must not come in a second time through the other mode: they would be counted twice.
TiBilletReseauLocal = Development mode
TiBilletReseauLocalAide = Only for a test on a development machine: name read from /etc/hosts, certificate not checked, http allowed. Keep unchecked in production.
TiBilletEnregistrer = Save
TiBilletTester = Test the connection
TiBilletImporterMaintenant = Import now
TiBilletReimporter = Re-import
TiBilletReimporterAide = Removes this closure's entries and writes them again with TiBillet's current chart of accounts. Impossible if a line is validated.
TiBilletReglagesEnregistres = Settings saved.
TiBilletClotureReimportee = Closure re-imported.
TiBilletClotures = Imported closures
TiBilletNumero = Closure no.
TiBilletDateComptable = Entries date
TiBilletDateImport = Imported on
TiBilletPieces = Pieces
TiBilletAucuneCloture = No closure imported yet.
TiBilletNonConfigure = Module not configured: fill in the venue address and the API key (Setup → Modules → TiBillet).
TiBilletConnexionOk = Connection OK: TiBillet returns %s accounts.
TiBilletResume = %s closure(s) imported (no. %s), %s account(s) created, %s journal(s) created.
TiBilletCleRefusee = Key refused by TiBillet (403): check the key, the "Accounting (read)" right and the key's IP address.
TiBilletInjoignable = TiBillet cannot be reached: %s
TiBilletRefus = TiBillet refused (%s): %s
TiBilletAdresseInvalide = The TiBillet venue address is not valid.
TiBilletHttpsObligatoire = The TiBillet venue address must start with https:// (the key never travels in clear).
TiBilletReponseIllisible = Unreadable answer from TiBillet.
TiBilletExerciceFerme = No open fiscal year for %s (TiBillet closure no. %s). Open or reopen the fiscal year (Accounting → Setup → Fiscal years), then run the import again. The following closures wait.
TiBilletPasDePlanComptable = No active chart of accounts in Dolibarr (Accounting → Setup → Chart of accounts).
TiBilletComptabiliteInactive = The "accounting entries" mode needs Dolibarr's "Double-entry accounting" module: save the module page in this mode to enable it.
TiBilletEcritureDejaPresente = Entry %s is already in the general ledger: nothing is written again.
TiBilletEcritureDesequilibree = Entry %s is not balanced: nothing is written.
TiBilletReimportRefuseValidee = Closure no. %s: a line is already validated, it cannot be re-imported.
TiBilletReimportRefuseExercice = Closure no. %s: some of its lines could not be removed (closed fiscal year?). Nothing changed.
TiBilletClotureInconnue = Unknown closure.
TiBilletErreurDolibarr = Dolibarr error: %s
TiBilletTacheDeNuit = TiBillet nightly job
TiBilletExplicationVentes = Every day at %s, Dolibarr copies TiBillet's catalogue (one product per price sold in euros, with its price incl. VAT, VAT, sales account and categories), then the sales of closed days: one paid invoice per sale (a credit note for a refund), to the buyer's third party (found by e-mail) or to the walk-in customer; top-ups and card emptyings as internal transfers; offered top-ups, gift tokens taken back and payment gaps as various payments. Per account, the result equals the FEC. Nothing is ever deleted.
TiBilletHeure = Nightly job time
TiBilletHeureAide = The run happens at this time, within 5 minutes. It only reads days already closed: TiBillet closes the day two hours after the venue's closing time, pick a later time (6 am by default). When the clocks change (summer / winter), save the page again to realign the job.
TiBilletHeureInvalide = Invalid time: write it as HH:MM (00:00 to 23:59). The job did not move.
TiBilletProchainPassage = Next run: %s
TiBilletTacheIntrouvable = The TiBillet nightly job cannot be found: disable then enable the module again.
TiBilletCleAideVentes = Created in TiBillet's admin (API keys), with the "Products", "Accounting (read)" and "Sales" rights. Leave empty to keep the saved key.
TiBilletCleSansDroitProduits = The key does not have the "Products" right (403): add it to the key in TiBillet's admin (API keys).
TiBilletCatalogueOk = Catalogue read: %s products.
TiBilletSynchroniserMaintenant = Sync the catalogue now
TiBilletModeEcrituresPasDeCatalogue = "Accounting entries" mode: the catalogue is not synced.
TiBilletModulesProduitsInactifs = Dolibarr's Products, Services and Categories modules must be enabled: save the module page in "items and sales" mode.
TiBilletCatalogueInchange = Catalogue unchanged since the last run: nothing to do.
TiBilletCategorieCaisse = TiBillet register
TiBilletCategorieTypes = TiBillet types
TiBilletResumeCatalogue = %s item(s) created, %s updated, %s unchanged.
TiBilletResumeCatalogueSuite = %s skipped (not sales in euros), %s not created (no account or no VAT), %s error(s).
TiBilletArticleNonCree = Not created: "%s". TiBillet says: %s
TiBilletErreurArticle = Error on "%s": %s
TiBilletArticleIllisible = TiBillet's answer lacks something (name, type, or a price's identifier or amount).
TiBilletArticlePasseHorsVente = Set not for sale: "%s". Reason: %s
TiBilletPlusUneVente = it is no longer a sale for accounting.
TiBilletPlusEnEuros = this price is no longer sold in euros.
TiBilletInchangeResumeDu = Catalogue unchanged since. Summary of the last full run (%s):
TiBilletCatalogueAvecErreurs = %s error(s) during the catalogue sync: the next night does it all again.
TiBilletCatalogue = TiBillet catalogue
TiBilletDernierPassage = Last run: %s
TiBilletAucunPassage = No run yet.

