TiBilletTotauxDifferents = Dolibarr finds %s incl. tax and %s excl. tax, TiBillet %s and %s.
TiBilletLigneLibre = Line without product (price missing from Dolibarr's catalogue): "%s".
TiBilletResumeVentes = %s sale(s) copied: %s invoice(s), %s credit note(s), %s internal transfer(s), %s various payment(s).
TiBilletResumeVentesClotures = %s closure(s) done.
TiBilletModuleInactif = Dolibarr's "%s" module is not enabled.
