TiBilletClientDePassage = TiBillet walk-in customer
TiBilletClientDePassageCree = Third party "TiBillet walk-in customer" created.
TiBilletCodeDePaiementActive = Payment mode %s enabled.
TiBilletCodeDePaiementCree = Payment mode %s created (TiBillet currencies).
TiBilletLibelleDuCodeTib = TiBillet currency
TiBilletClotureEnModeVentes = This closure was imported in "items and sales" mode (invoices): it is never re-imported as entries, or it would be counted twice.
TiBilletImporterLesVentes = Import the sales now
TiBilletVentes = TiBillet sales
TiBilletBanques = Banks and walk-in customer
TiBilletBanquesAide = Each TiBillet treasury account (cash, card, Stripe, local currency…) has its Dolibarr bank, created by the module at the first payment. You can choose another one. A "cash" bank only takes cash.
TiBilletCompteTiBillet = TiBillet account
TiBilletBanqueDolibarr = Dolibarr bank
