TiBilletReglagesPrets = Dolibarr is ready to receive the sales.
TiBilletModeVentesCourt = sales
TiBilletModeEcrituresCourt = entries
TiBilletCleSansDroitVentes = The key lacks the "Sales" right: in TiBillet's admin, tick "Sales" on this key.
TiBilletClotureEnPartieEnVentes = Part of this closure's sales are already in Dolibarr as invoices ("items and sales" mode): it does not go into the general ledger, or those sales would be counted twice.
